{
    "title": "Word Relax: Word Puzzle Games",
    "description": "\ud83d\udc95 Playing Word Relax 10 mins a day sharpens your mind and wow your daily zen life and challenges! \ud83d\udc95\r\n\r\nWord Relax is the most exciting match word games in this planet! Word Relax shows you how easy to bound with cross words, wiz text; gets harder and more challenging as you level up!\r\n\r\nEnjoy Brain Challenge Forest Trip Word Game!\r\nMore than 15000 levels to connect twist word games, word searching, anagrams and daily crosswords.\r\n\u27a4 Connect scramble letters to form the word matches!\r\n\u27a4 Challenge yourself to guess connections, find words and earn free rewards! \r\n\u27a4 Fill in word block jumbles! Earn bonus when you discover hidden words!\r\n\u27a4 Can\u2019t figure out the word tiles jumble? Get a hint and crush the cryptogram!\r\n\u27a4 Unlock stunning landscape backgrounds to escape from home garden and relax your brain.\r\n\r\nWord Relax also has many addictive special event word games, such as the Four-Leaf event, Lucky Fireflies, and other fever carnival fest.\r\n\r\n=== Features ===\r\n\u27a4 Daily rises bonus rewards!\r\n\u27a4 Daily Crossword Puzzle gives you calm & serenity mind\r\n\u27a4 Over 15000+ Levels word games!\r\n\u27a4 Welcome you with 500 stars and reward you 300 stars when you sign up\r\n\u27a4 Easy at first and difficulty increases as your level bloom!\r\n\u27a4 Play Offline or Online - Wherever you are\r\n\u27a4 Word Relax is the best wealth word game!\r\n\u27a4 Get your zenith vitamin of daily brain training with this crossword puzzle word game. Lovers of classic word games like Scrabble, crosswords or anagrams will love this jam word hunt and spell vocabulary game. You can connect to grid words with friends, a flow of daily trails crossword solo, or solve and spell anagrams wherever universe you are!\r\nDownload Word Relax for the best word games for word game fans, word search addicts, and more!\r\nPlay word games now with Word Relax \u2013 it\u2019s so addictive, relief & meditative!\r\n\r\nHave an issue with these word games for android? For immediate support, contact us at hello@tgmeadia.vn. Thanks!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83d\udc95 Playing Word Relax 10 mins a day sharpens your mind and wow your daily zen life and challenges! \ud83d\udc95<br><br>Word Relax is the most exciting match word games in this planet! Word Relax shows you how easy to bound with cross words, wiz text; gets harder and more challenging as you level up!<br><br>Enjoy Brain Challenge Forest Trip Word Game!<br>More than 15000 levels to connect twist word games, word searching, anagrams and daily crosswords.<br>\u27a4 Connect scramble letters to form the word matches!<br>\u27a4 Challenge yourself to guess connections, find words and earn free rewards! <br>\u27a4 Fill in word block jumbles! Earn bonus when you discover hidden words!<br>\u27a4 Can\u2019t figure out the word tiles jumble? Get a hint and crush the cryptogram!<br>\u27a4 Unlock stunning landscape backgrounds to escape from home garden and relax your brain.<br><br>Word Relax also has many addictive special event word games, such as the Four-Leaf event, Lucky Fireflies, and other fever carnival fest.<br><br>=== Features ===<br>\u27a4 Daily rises bonus rewards!<br>\u27a4 Daily Crossword Puzzle gives you calm &amp; serenity mind<br>\u27a4 Over 15000+ Levels word games!<br>\u27a4 Welcome you with 500 stars and reward you 300 stars when you sign up<br>\u27a4 Easy at first and difficulty increases as your level bloom!<br>\u27a4 Play Offline or Online - Wherever you are<br>\u27a4 Word Relax is the best wealth word game!<br>\u27a4 Get your zenith vitamin of daily brain training with this crossword puzzle word game. Lovers of classic word games like Scrabble, crosswords or anagrams will love this jam word hunt and spell vocabulary game. You can connect to grid words with friends, a flow of daily trails crossword solo, or solve and spell anagrams wherever universe you are!<br>Download Word Relax for the best word games for word game fans, word search addicts, and more!<br>Play word games now with Word Relax \u2013 it\u2019s so addictive, re